<title>USA: Allegiance Corp issues $550 million debt.</title>
<headline>Allegiance Corp issues $550 million debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following multi-tranche debt issue was priced on Wednesday, said lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co.</p>
<p>BORROWER ALLEGIANCE CORP</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	  COUPON 7.30 PCT     MATURITY 10/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	    ISS PRICE 99.789    PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA3     SPREAD 78 BP	  PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS  YIELD 7.33 PCT	CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	  COUPON 7.80 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/16</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES     ISS PRICE 99.589  PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA3     SPREAD 98 BP	PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-MINUS  YIELD 7.841 PCT   CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER 30-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p>AMT $200 MLN	  COUPON 7.00 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/26</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES     ISS PRICE 99.929  PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA3     SPREAD 57 BP	PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
